  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>30</mn></math><br />Where <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The number of solutions of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math> is <math><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, the required number of solutions<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math><br />",
